Dear Brent and Zoe,

=20

I hope you are well.

=20

GENERAL =E2=80=93 PROCESS GOING FORWARD:

=20

This is my second email regarding Oxus and the respondent=E2=80=99s false represe=
ntations to the court during the Final Trial.

This is my third email requesting clarity on the process going forward.

=20

Zoe emailed today: =E2=80=9CAs Brent advised on Thursday, we should first ascerta=
in Karim=E2=80=99s position in relation to Oxus before considering any next steps=E2=
=80=9D.=20

This is not a satisfactory answer because time is not neutral. The passage =
of time is positive for the respondent and negative for me. I need something=
 better, more precise, and I need an explanation.

=20

Basic game theory states that the respondent=E2=80=99s best alternative is to not=
 answer our request and to delay as much as possible. This is what he has do=
ne with every single issue that what NOT in his best interest, including: Im=
erman, NY appraisals, Coinbase, Forte Securities. This is what he is doing n=
ow.

=20

Basic game theory states that the sooner I send this to the judge, the more=
 impact it will have on his judgement.

=20

I am not willing to wait indefinitely for the respondent to provide an answ=
er which we all know he will need a gun to his head to produce as it is huge=
ly negative to his case.

=20

In the absence of any guidelines from you and Zoe regarding how long you ar=
e asking me to wait for an answer which I know will not be forthcoming, and =
in the absence of any communications from you and Zoe since 29 February 2024=
,  I am utterly without guidance and advice at a stage which is critical for=
 the rest of my life and my daughters=E2=80=99 financial future.=20

=20

Thus, unless you and Zoe communicate with me and explain what the process i=
s from now to the end, and what the deadline for the respondent to responden=
t to Oxus and what are the supporting arguments behind your proposed deadlin=
e, I have decided to send the Oxus matter to His Lordship tomorrow by noon b=
ecause I have no way of knowing what is best for me given the absence of com=
munication from counsel and from my solicitor.=20

=20
I have been extremely clear that I will not take any chances with the proce=
ss from now until the time the money is in the bank.
I have explained that I would like COMPLETE CLARITY AS TO WHAT LEVEL OF SUP=
PORT AND ADVICE AND GUIDANCE I CAN EXPECT FROM YOU.=20
I HAVE EXPLAINED THAT I AM NOT IN A RISK-TAKING MODE AND I WANT AN ERROR-FR=
EE EXECUTION PROCESS FROM NOW UNTIL THE TIME THE MONEY IS IN THE BANK, AND M=
UST BE EXTREMELY VIGILENT WITH THE COURT ORDERS.
I HAVE EXPLAINED THAT I COMPLETELY UNDERSTAND IF YOU AND ZOE ARE NOT FUNDED=
 TO PROVIDE THE LEVEL OF HAND HOLDING, I AM REQUESTING BUT I WOULE LIKE YOU =
TO TELL ME NOW. NOT TOMORROW. BUT NOW.
THEN, I WILL BE FREE TO EXPLORE OPTIONS THAT WORK FOR ME.  THE PROCESS AHEA=
D OF US HAS HUGE EXECUTION RISKS AND I NEED HAND HOLDING, COMMUNICATION, EXP=
ERT ADVICE, AND EXTREME VIGILENCE.=20
IF YOU CANNOT PROVIDE WHAT I NEED, YOU MUST TELL ME KNOW SO I CAN DO WHAT I=
S BEST FOR ME AND MY DAUGHTERS.
I CANNOT STAY IN THE DARK ABOUT THE FORTHCOMING PROCESS. THIS IS NOT AN OPT=
ION. EVERY DAY AND EVERY MINUTE COUNTS. I NEED OPEN CHANNELS OF COMMUNICATIO=
N; I NEED TO UNDERSTAND THE PROCESS.=20
I NEED TO HAVE EXTREMELY CLEAR AND REALISTIC EXPECTATIONS. PLEASE SET OUT W=
HAT SCAFFOLDING (IN ANY) YOU CAN PROVIDE ME UNTIL THE END OF THE PROCESS.
IF IT IS NOT SUFFICIENT FOR ME, THEN IT IS MY JOB TO FIND A SET UP THAT WOR=
KS FOR ME.
FOR NOW, YOU ARE HOLDING ME BACK BECAUSE YOU SAID YOU ARE NOT IN FUNDS AND =
NOW YOU ARE NOT TELLING ME WHAT THAT MEANS IN TERMS OF MY CASE.
I SAID VERY CLEARLY WHAT MY NEEDS AND EXPECTATIONS ARE.
I UNDERSTAND YOU ARE NOT IN FUNDS AND I RESPECT YOU RUN A BUSINESS, NOT A C=
HARITABLE ORGANISATION.
PLEASE EXPLAIN TO ME VERY CLEARLY WHAT YOU CAN DELIVER (IF ANY) AND WHAT YO=
U CANNOT.
STAYING IN THE DARK IS NOT AN OPTION. I NEED TO DECIDE AND MOVE FORWARD. MY=
 LIFE AND MY CHILDREN=E2=80=99S FREEDOM DEPENDS ON WHAT I DO IN THE NEXT FEW WEEKS=
.
I CANNOT AFFORD ANY UNCERTAINTY AND I NEED EXACTLY WHAT I SPELT OUT ABOVE: =
HAND-HOLDING AT EVERY STEP, EXTREME VIGILENCE WITH THE COURT ORDERS, SEEMLES=
S COMMUNICATION BETWEEN ME, YOU AND BRENT, UNTIL THE MONEY IS IN THE BANK AN=
D MY FUTURE LITIGATIONS AGAINST THE RESPONDENDENT ARE SECURE AND UNOPPOSED B=
Y THIS COURT.
IF THIS IS NOT POSSIBLE, TELL ME IMMEDIATELY, IN WRITING, SO I AM FREE TO C=
ONSIDER THE OPTIONS THAT SUIT MY NEEDS AS DEFINED BY ME.
=20

OXUS: GRANT DATE (CONDITIONAL) VS TRIGGER DATE VS VESTING DATE

=20

I am presenting the key points supporting my position that the respondent l=
ied under oath and made flagrant false representation, that the respondent k=
new and should have known that his 50,000 shares were NOT worth zero at the =
time of the Final Trial, and that he intentionally made representations he k=
new to be false and took the Court and me for fools in order to keep the win=
dfall for himself.

=20

I am adding the vesting schedule so you can understand the full picture.

=20

Further to my email of 29 February 2024 setting out the timeline of the clo=
sing of the transaction and the consummation of the acquisition by Oxus of B=
orealis (the Target), the business combination closed on 7th February 2024 a=
nd, on 8th February 2024, Newco began trading on Nasdaq under the ticker sym=
bol BRLS.

=20

As per the attached SEC filings and as discussed at our meeting on 29 Febru=
ary 2024, here is a recap of the events:

=20
The respondent was granted 50,000 Founders=E2=80=99 shares on 7 June 2022 (page 3=
41 of attached SEC Prospectus)
The Founder Shares were granted subject to a performance condition (i.e., t=
he occurrence of a Business Combination).
The Business Combination occurred on 7th February 2024.
Newco began trading on Nasdaq on 8th February 2024 under the ticker symbol =
BRLS.
The Founder Shares lock-up period is defined below and in page 5 of the Pro=
spectus filed with the SEC (attached).
=20

=20

FALSE REPRESENTATIONS TO HIS LORDSHIP UNDER OATH: THERE ARE THREE DATES WHI=
CH FAMILY COURT MUST UNDERSTAND: (I) GRANT DATE, (II) EFFECTIVE DATE, AND (I=
II) VESTING DATE.=20

=20
STEP 1: GRANT DATE: GIVES THE RESPONDENT OWNERSHIP OF 50,000 CONDITIONAL TO=
 BUSINESS COMBINATION.
STEP 2: EFFECTIVE DATE: GIVES THE RESPONDENT UNCONDITIONAL OWNERSHIP OF 50,=
000 SHARES UPON CLOSING OF THE BUSINESS COMBINATION.
STEP 3: VESTING SCHEDULE: GIVES THE RESPONDENT THE RIGHT TO SELL HIS SHARES=
 ACCORDING TO A TWO-TIER SCHEDULE.
=20

THE RESPONDENT HAS MADE AN INTENTIONAL WORLD SALAD OF THE ABOVE AND IS ONCE=
 AGAIN LEVERAGING HIS ASYMETRICAL KNOWLEDGE OF FINANCE IN ORDER TO CREATE CO=
NFUSION BETWEEN THE THREE DATES (I) THE GRANT DATE (7 JUNE 2022), (II) THE E=
FFECTIVE DATE (COMPLETION OF BUSINESS COMBINATION 7TH FEBRUARY 2024) AND (II=
I) VESTING DATE (50% FORMULA AND 50% 12 MONTHS AFTER BUSINESS COMBINATION).

=20

TESTIMONY UNDER OATH AT THE FINAL TRIAL

=20

ON 19TH FEBRUARY 2024, THE FINAL TRIAL =E2=80=9CZAHMOUL VS ZAHMOUL=E2=80=9D BEGAN IN TH=
E RCJ, HIGH COURT FAMILY DIVISION, BEFORE HIS LORDSHIP JUSTICE MACDONALD.

=20

THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT MADE DURING THE TRIAL UNDER OATH:  =E2=80=9CTHE FOUNDERS=E2=
=80=99 SHARES HELD BY THE RESPONDENT ARE WORTH ZERO=E2=80=9D IS A FALSE STATEMENT AND =
LIE MADE TO THE COURT UNDER OATH.

=20

THE RESPONDENT FALSELY REPRESENTED TO THE COURT UNDER OATH THAT HIS 50,000 =
SHARES WERE WORTH =E2=80=9CZERO=E2=80=9D AND THAT HE WOULD NOT KNOW THEIR VALUE UNTIL ON=
E YEAR HAS PASSED. THIS IS AN INTENTIOANL MISREPRESENTATION AND IT IS A FALS=
E STATEMENT. THE VALUE OF THE RESPONDENT=E2=80=99S HOLDINGS CAN NOW BE TRACKED DAI=
LY ON A MARKED-TO-MARKET BASIS USING BRLS PRICE PERFORMANCE. THE RESPONDENT =
CAN MONETIZE THIS POSITION, BORROW AGAINST IT, pleadge it, use it as collate=
ral, USE IT IN HIS ASSET SCHEDULE WHEN APPLYING TO MORTGAGE INSTITUTIONS, ET=
C. IT IS PART OF HIS ASSETS AND IT HAS A VALUE OF APPROXIMATELY $0.5 MILLION=
. VESTING PERIOD HAS NOTHING TO DO WITH OWNERSHIP OF THE ASSET. THE ASSET HA=
S A VALUE AND THE ASSET CAN NOW BE INCLUDED IN THE RESPONDENT=E2=80=99S PERSONAL B=
ALANCE SHEET.

=20

MORE IMPORTANTLY, AS OF 7 FEBRUARY 2024, THE RESPONDENT HAD A DUTY TO UPDAT=
E HIS FORM E AND REPORT HIS 50,000 FOUNDERS SHARES IN OXUS AT THE VALUE OF $=
0.5 MILLION.

=20

AT THE TIME HE MADE THIS STATEMENT AND HE INSTRUCTED HIS COUNSEL TO SAY THE=
 SAME, THIS WAS A FALSE REPRESENTATION AND THE RESPONDENT KNEW IT TO BE A FA=
LSE REPRESENTATION.

=20

THERE IS NO STRESS, NO INNUENDOS, NO EXCUSES, NO KITE SURFING: THIS IS A PR=
EMEDITATED, CALCULATED, AND INTENTIONAL FALSE REPRESENTATION WITH THE INTENT=
 TO MAKE A FINANCIAL GAIN AT MY EXPENSE.=20

=20

THE RESPONDENT IS TAKING THE COURT AND ME FOR FOOLS.

=20

